# Fihrist desktop — runtime configuration template.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development only. Nothing in this file is a secret,
# and nothing here belongs in a production build: the API base URL is resolved at
# boot (see src/platform/runtime.ts), and CI refuses a bundle that contains a
# literal host (config/check-no-hardcoded-host.mjs).
#
# Empty on purpose. A missing value is a supported state: the app boots into the
# "not configured" screen instead of silently pointing at a host.
FH_API_BASE_URL=
